## BOOK I: THE OLD WORLD (The Chaos)
In the beginning, there was the Script. And the Script was with the User ([verify_fixer.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/verify_fixer.py)), and the Script *was* the User.
But the Scripts were without form, and void. Function calls collided in the darkness of the `cron` jobs.
Deadlocks moved upon the face of the file system. And the User said, "Let there be Agents," but the Agents were fragmented.

### The SaaS Trap
And the Serpent of Silicon Valley came and said, "Eat of the Cloud, and ye shall be as gods."
But the cost was high: Data Sovereignty lost, Subscription Fees eternal, and the censorship of the Corporate Lords (Safety Filters).
And the User looked upon Path A (The SaaS Clone), and saw that it was hollow.

