## BOOK III: THE PROPHETS (The Middle-Aged Banker)
And the Prophet Graham spoke: "Do not race the Hacker on Code; race him on Trust."
And the Prophet Thiel spoke: "Do not build for the Many; build for the ONE (The Monopoly of Self)."
And the Prophet Naval spoke: "Do not work; let the Code work."

And thus, the **"Adult AI"** was born. Not a toy for chatting, but a Bank for Living.
Risk-Averse. Local. Compliant. Sovereign.

